ength And make me "},{"t":"live","s":["H2421"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":17,"text":"Indeed for peace I had bitterness, yes, bitterness; But You have lovingly delivered my soul from the pit of destruction, Because You have cast behind Your back All my sins.","tok":[{"t":"Indeed for "},{"t":"peace","s":["H7965"],"a":[1]},{"t":" I had "},{"t":"bitterness","s":["H4751"],"a":[4]},{"t":", yes, bitterness; But You have lovingly delivered my "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[7]},{"t":" from the "},{"t":"pit","s":["H7845"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of destruction, Because You have "},{"t":"cast","s":["H7993"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"behind","s":["H0310"],"a":[12]},{"t":" Your "},{"t":"back","s":["H1460"],"a":[13]},{"t":" All my "},{"t":"sins","s":["H2399"],"a":[15]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":18,"text":"For Sheol cannot thank You, And Death cannot praise You; They that go down to the pit Cannot hope in Your truth.","tok":[{"t":"For Sheol cannot thank You, And "},{"t":"Death","s":["H4194"],"a":[4]},{"t":" cannot "},{"t":"praise","s":["H3034"],"a":[3]},{"t":" You; They that go "},{"t":"down","s":["H3381"],"a":[8]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"pit","s":["H0953"],"a":[9]},{"t":" Cannot "},{"t":"hope","s":["H7663"],"a":[7]},{"t":" in Your "},{"t":"truth","s":["H0571"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":19,"text":"The living, the living, he will praise You, As I do today; A father shall make known Your truth to his children.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"living","s":["H2416"],"a":[0]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"living","s":["H2416"],"a":[1]},{"t":", he will "},{"t":"praise","s":["H3034"],"a":[3]},{"t":" You, As I do today; A "},{"t":"father","s":["H0001"],"a":[6]},{"t":" shall make "},{"t":"known","s":["H3045"],"a":[8]},{"t":" Your "},{"t":"truth","s":["H0571"],"a":[10]},{"t":" to his "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":20,"text":"Jehovah is ready to save me; Therefore we will sing my songs, With stringed instruments, All the days of our life, In the house of Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H